flowchart TD
    START --> identify_tool

    identify_tool -->|Supported tool found| parse_parameters
    identify_tool -->|Low confidence| clarify_tool
    identify_tool -->|No matching tool| unsupported
    clarify_tool -->|Interrupt: ask user which action| identify_tool
    unsupported --> END

    parse_parameters --> decide_next_step

    decide_next_step -->|Required fields missing| collect_missing_parameters
    decide_next_step -->|All required fields present| confirm

    collect_missing_parameters -->|Interrupt: ask user; LLM extracts values or corrections| decide_next_step
    collect_missing_parameters -->|User cancels| cancel
    collect_missing_parameters -->|User wants a different action| identify_tool
    collect_missing_parameters -->|Too many unusable replies| give_up

    confirm -->|Interrupt: ask user to approve| classify_confirmation
    classify_confirmation -->|Confirmed| prepare_command
    classify_confirmation -->|Rejected| cancel
    classify_confirmation -->|Modify values| decide_next_step
    classify_confirmation -->|Unclear: ask again| confirm
    classify_confirmation -->|Too many unclear replies| give_up

    prepare_command --> END
    cancel --> END
    give_up --> END
